sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant WD as Workers Dashboard
    participant AM as Analytics Module
    participant API as Backend API
    participant CHM as Chat Modal
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant TM as Task Manager

    Note over U, WD: User monitors worker performance
    U->>WD: Access workers dashboard
    WD->>API: GET /api/metrics/overview
    API->>AM: Calculate performance metrics
    AM->>API: Return KPIs
    API->>WD: Performance data
    WD->>U: Display metrics (73% utilization, 87% efficiency)
    
    Note over U, WD: User reviews individual worker performance
    WD->>U: Show worker cards with performance ratings
    U->>WD: Notice underperforming worker (SEO Specialist - 0%)
    WD->>U: Show "No active task" status
    
    Note over U, WD: Investigate underperformance
    U->>WD: Click on SEO Specialist card
    WD->>CHM: Open chat modal
    CHM->>API: GET /api/workers/seo-specialist/status
    API->>CHM: Return worker context
    CHM->>U: Display idle worker interface
    
    Note over U, CHM: Diagnose worker status
    U->>CHM: "Why aren't you working on anything?"
    CHM->>W: Process inquiry
    W->>TM: Check assigned tasks
    TM->>W: No active tasks found
    W->>CHM: "No active tasks assigned to me"
    CHM->>U: Display response
    
    Note over U, CHM: Assign new task
    U->>CHM: "Please audit our website SEO"
    CHM->>W: Process task request
    W->>TM: Create SEO audit task
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create
    API->>TM: Task created
    TM->>CHM: Update active tasks
    CHM->>U: Show new task in progress
    
    Note over W, TM: Worker begins execution
    W->>TM: Update task status to "Running"
    TM->>AM: Log worker activity
    AM->>WD: Update real-time metrics
    
    Note over U, WD: Monitor performance improvement
    U->>CHM: Click "Save & Continue Later"
    CHM->>WD: Return to dashboard
    WD->>API: GET /api/metrics/current
    API->>AM: Get updated metrics
    AM->>API: Return refreshed data
    API->>WD: Updated performance data
    WD->>U: Show improved utilization (78% → 85%)
    
    Note over U, WD: Review overall performance trends
    U->>WD: Review performance metrics section
    WD->>U: Display trends (+5% utilization, +3% completion rate)
    
    Note over U, WD: Optimize worker allocation
    U->>WD: Click "Bulk Assign Tasks"
    WD->>U: Show bulk assignment interface
    U->>WD: Select multiple idle workers
    U->>WD: Assign tasks from queue
    WD->>API: POST /api/tasks/bulk-assign
    
    loop For each selected worker
        API->>TM: Assign task to worker
        TM->>W: Send task assignment
        W->>TM: Acknowledge assignment
    end
    
    TM->>AM: Update worker utilization metrics
    AM->>WD: Push metric updates
    WD->>U: Show improved overall utilization
    
    Note over AM, WD: Continuous monitoring
    AM->>AM: Calculate efficiency scores
    AM->>WD: Update dashboard metrics every 30s
    WD->>U: Show real-time performance updates
    
    Note over U, WD: Performance optimization completed
    WD->>U: Display optimized metrics (91% utilization, 89% efficiency) 